Soil Contamination and Food Chain Transfer in Niger State, Nigeria
Mohammed Abubakar Mohammed1, Angwa Egbe Monday2, Mary Aderonke Oguntuase3, Abubakar
Muhammad Jaafar4
1
Department of Geology, Federal University of Lafia, Nigeria
Jacmed Geo Centre, Nasarawa State University, Keffi, Nigeria
