Non-Structural Carbohydrates Accumulation in Contrasting Rice
Genotypes Subjected to High Night Temperatures
Diogo S. Moura1, Giovani G. Brito2, Ângela D. Campos2, Ítalo L. Moraes1, Fabiane G. S. Porto2,
Sheila B. Teixeira1, Paulo R. R. Fagundes2, André Andres2, Fábio Schreiber2 & Sidnei Deuner1
