from the coast of Red Sea: Avicennia marina as potential metal bioaccumulator. Ecotoxicol. Environ. Saf. 97:
263–270.
Zabin, S.A. & Howladar, S.M. 2015. Accumulation of Cu,
Ni and Pb in selected native plants growing naturally
in sediments of water reservoir dams, Albaha Region,
KSA.Nature and Science 13(3): 11–17.

CONCLUSIONS

Overall, the study shows the translocation of As and
other trace metals into higher animals through the food

